	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士ガンダム THE ORIGIN 激突 ルウム会戦』に登場するザクIIが最新フォーマットでHG化！",
			"• C型、C-5型が選択式で組立可能となっており、C-5型は形状の違う胸部中央と左右ブロックが新規造形！",
			"• 兵装オプションとして、腕部のガトリングと、形状の異なるバックパックも付属する。",
			"• 背部にはベルト給弾式MS用マシンガンのマガジンを装備可能なほか、MS用バズーカ、対艦ライフルなど豊富な武装も付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The Zaku II that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam THE ORIGIN Clash at Loum\" is now HG in the latest format!",
			"• C type and C-5 type can be assembled selectively, and the C-5 type has a new model with a different shaped chest center and left and right blocks!",
			"• Gatling arms and a backpack with a different shape are also included as weapon options.",
			"• In addition to being able to equip the back with a magazine for a belt-fed MS machine gun, it also comes with a variety of armaments such as an MS bazooka and anti-ship rifle!"
		]
	},
